	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Panel hole for an Alpha RD901F 9 mm potentiometer bushing (M7), 7 mm non-plated. Origin at the hole centre. Same family as Hole_3.2mm / Hole_4.95mm / Hole_6mm: pad layers are *.Cu plus 'Rescue', matching those byte-for-byte. 'Rescue' is a stale layer name inherited from the original out-of-tree 'Panel' library and is NOT in a panel's layer table, so KiCad ignores it and the hole gets no mask aperture. Do not 'correct' it to *.Mask: that would open soldermask around every hole, and would put this footprint out of step with the other three and raise lib_footprint_mismatch DRC errors.")
